      "value": "<h2><em>Rank 2 Ki Technique</em></h2>\n<ul>\n<li><strong>Ki Cost:</strong> 20 Ki</li>\n<li><strong>Prerequisites:</strong> None</li>\n<li><strong>Casting Time:</strong> 1 Action</li>\n<li><strong>Range:</strong> 90 Feet</li>\n<li><strong>Chargeable?:</strong>          Yes</li>\n<li><strong>Duration:</strong>          Instantaneous</li>\n<li><strong>Type:</strong> Barrage</li>\n</ul>\n<p>Let out an immensly disruptive volley of attacks. Roll a <em>Barrage Attack Roll</em> dealing your <em>Basic Ki Blast Damage Die</em> + 3d12 <em>Damage</em> and gains the <em>Stunned Condition</em> until the end of their next turn on a hit.</p>\n",
